### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/

### All contacts API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/

### Get a contact API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af07fbdd4509d952f202b8a

### Add a new contact
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cengiz",
  "age": 23
}

###

### Modifie a contact
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af07fbdd4509d952f202b8a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cengiz"
}

###

### Delete a contact
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6afec3c55d8d071be41e64e8
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YWZlYzIyZDE1YjZiNDFiNjJjY2Q4NDEiLCJlbWFpbCI6ImNlbmdpekBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc5NTA4MTEzOCwiZXhwIjoxNzk1MDg0NzM4fQ.xXBVxweJMCWAyZsJdufsvBDgNCiknEPToZP1I2bNTM8

### Register a new user 
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cengiz@example.com",
  "password": "mdpSecure33!"
}

###

### Connect to obtain the JWT
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cengiz@example.com",
  "password": "mdpSecure33!"
}

###

### Contacts list with protected access
